---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import SearchOverlay from '../components/SearchOverlay.astro';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | SolversPro"
  description="Terms of Service for SolversPro. Understand your rights and responsibilities when using our 78+ free online tools."
>
  <Header />
  <SearchOverlay />
  
  <main class="flex-1 py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mb-10">Effective Date: January 1, {year}</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg text-zinc-400">
        <p>
          Welcome to SolversPro. By accessing and using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provisions of this agreement.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>
          SolversPro provides a collection of 74+ free, browser-based tools spanning the following categories: <strong>Developer Tools</strong> (JSON/XML tools, format converters, data-to-class generators, diff tools, code beautifiers, string escapers, Base64, JWT decoder, hash generators, regex tester, code minifier, etc.), <strong>PDF Tools</strong> (merge, split, protect, flatten, convert, compose), <strong>Text Tools</strong> (word counter, case converter, Morse code, URL encoder, lorem ipsum, number to words), <strong>Math Tools</strong> (scientific calculator, quadratic solver, matrix calculator, statistics, unit converter, geometry, random number generator), <strong>Finance Calculators</strong> (live currency converter, compound interest, simple interest, mortgage, ROI, cash-on-cash return), <strong>Health Calculators</strong> (BMI, TDEE), <strong>Trades Calculators</strong> (concrete slab, wire size, solar panel, board feet, paint), <strong>Network Tools</strong> (IP subnet calculator, My IP checker, IP lookup), <strong>Security Tools</strong> (password generator), <strong>QR Code Tools</strong> (QR code generator), and an <strong>AI-powered Universal Solver</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Use of Our Tools</h2>
        <p>
          These tools are provided for <strong>informational and educational purposes only</strong>. While we strive to ensure the accuracy of our tools, we cannot guarantee their absolute precision.
        </p>
        <p>
          You should not rely solely on the results of these tools for critical decisions. In particular:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4 mb-6">
          <li><strong>Financial tools:</strong> Results from compound interest, mortgage, ROI, and other finance calculators should not substitute professional financial advice. Always consult a qualified financial advisor before making investment or lending decisions.</li>
          <li><strong>Health tools:</strong> BMI and TDEE calculations are general estimates. They should not replace professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a healthcare provider for health-related decisions.</li>
          <li><strong>Trades & engineering tools:</strong> Concrete, wire size, solar panel, and other trades calculators provide estimates. Always consult licensed contractors, electricians, or engineers and verify calculations against local building codes before beginning any construction or electrical work.</li>
          <li><strong>PDF tools:</strong> While our PDF tools (merge, split, protect, flatten, convert) process files entirely in your browser, we cannot guarantee compatibility with every PDF viewer or that encrypted PDFs meet specific compliance standards. Always verify the output before using processed documents in official or legal contexts.</li>
          <li><strong>Network tools:</strong> IP lookup and geolocation results are provided by third-party APIs and may not be perfectly accurate. Do not use these results for security-critical decisions.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. Artificial Intelligence Tools</h2>
        <p>
          Our Universal AI Solver utilizes third-party large language models (Google Gemini) to generate solutions. AI models can hallucinate or produce inaccurate, incomplete, or misleading information. You <strong>must independently verify</strong> any answers, code, equations, or recommendations generated by the AI before using them in any professional, academic, or safety-critical capacity.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are not responsible for any consequences arising from reliance on AI-generated content.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Privacy & Data Processing</h2>
        <p>
          The majority of our tools run entirely in your web browser. Your input data is processed locally on your device and is not transmitted to our servers. For details on tools that do transmit data to third-party services (AI Solver, network tools), please review our <a href="/privacy" class="text-[#2dd4bf] hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. Progressive Web App (PWA)</h2>
        <p>
          SolversPro is available as a Progressive Web App (PWA) that can be installed on your device for offline access. While we strive to keep the PWA version up to date, cached content may occasionally be outdated. The PWA auto-updates when connected to the internet, but we cannot guarantee immediate synchronization of all features.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          The content, layout, design, data, and graphics on this website are protected by intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, duplicate, or copy material from SolversPro without our explicit permission.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The materials and tools on SolversPro are provided "as is". SolversPro makes no warranties, expressed or implied, and hereby disclaims and negates all other warranties, including without limitation, implied warranties or conditions of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement of intellectual property or other violation of rights.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">8. Limitations of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall SolversPro or its creators be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of data or profit, or due to business interruption) arising out of the use or inability to use the tools on SolversPro, even if we have been notified orally or in writing of the possibility of such damage.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          Any claim relating to SolversPro shall be governed by the laws of the applicable jurisdiction without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms of Service from time to time as we add new tools and features. We encourage you to review this page periodically for any changes. Continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">11. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#2dd4bf] hover:underline">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
